1	api	Validate, freeze rate, create order + run, return 202	received	root, satellite, run, outbox
2	worker	validate_request, verify_instrument (account token verified)	authorizing	step rows, cr_ach.verified_at
3	worker → eligibility	check_eligibility — approved, decision snapshotted	authorizing	eligibility_decision
4	worker → ledger gw	place_hold 25,000 pts	authorized	ledger_hold held, outbox
5	worker → ACH rail	submit_disbursement — entry staged, trace number returned	fulfilling	disbursement submitted
6	worker	await_rail_confirmation — run parked	awaiting_settlement	run waiting
7	ingest	Settlement acknowledgement file consumed, run woken	awaiting_settlement	inbox, disbursement_event
8	worker → ledger gw	settle_hold — points permanently debited	completed	hold settled, outbox
