9.2 ACH — return after settlement (R01, insufficient funds at the receiving bank)
#	Actor	Action	Status after	Persisted
1	ingest	Return file with code R01 for a trace number; matched to disbursement	completed	inbox, disbursement_event, disbursement returned
2	worker	watch_reversal_window wakes, opens a reverse step	completed	reversal pending
3	worker → ledger gw	RestorePoints — a new compensating entry, not a rollback of the settlement	reversed	reversal completed, outbox
4	worker	Notify with the return reason; order stays terminal	reversed	step rows, audit_log
The audit trail deliberately shows both movements — a debit that settled and a restoration that followed — because the member's statement and the ledger must agree on what actually happened, not on a tidied-up net.

